Standalone community platform for the Lodos ecosystem. Built on Next.js 15 (App Router) + React 19 + TypeScript, with a Next BFF that fronts the shared backend.

- **Channel messaging** — Real-time chat with file uploads, reactions, starring, typing indicators
- **Direct messages** — Private conversations with read receipts
- **DM voice & video calls** — 1-on-1 LiveKit-powered calls with an inline split layout (tiles on top, chat below)
- **Channel voice rooms** — Discord-style persistent voice/video rooms scoped to a channel
- **Announcements** — Channel-wide broadcasts with filtering
- **Gallery** — Media collections with likes, labels, and comments
- **Discover** — Find and join channels via search or invite links
- **Channel settings** — Admin tools for member management, room organization
